OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to possessing an
OL,4,Aassault rifle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to possessing
OL,7,Fan assault rifle seized by police
OL,8,Fduring an undercover surveillance
OL,9,Foperation.
OL,11,FPatrick James Collett, of
OL,12,FRossnagalliagh in Londonderry, appeared
OL,13,Fat Belfast Crown Court to be formally
OL,14,Fre-arraigned on a charge he had
OL,15,Fpreviously denied.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
