OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to possessing an
OL,4,Aassault rifle
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe is charged that on 21 May 2024, he
OL,7,Fhad in his possession a firearm and
OL,8,Fammunition and a magazine loaded with
OL,9,Fseven cartridges with intent to
OL,10,Fendanger life or to enable another
OL,11,Fperson to endanger life or cause damage
OL,12,Fto property.
OL,14,FWhen the charges were put to him
OL,15,FCollett replied: "Guilty on the second
OL,16,Flimb.''
